 "strengths_and_weaknesses": "Strengths: 27-year operating history at the same location, three years of revenue and EBITDA growth, experienced owner with a clean payment record at this bank, purchase removes landlord risk. Weaknesses: the surgical-suite revenue depends on contracting a boarded surgeon, which has not yet been signed; staffing costs are rising; business collateral does not fully cover the loan.",
